        F (Z_to_bv 64 pc) fc None mm (seg_rom asegs)).
  Notation W := [(bv_unsigned a0, bv_unsigned a0 + bv_unsigned a2); (bv_unsigned sp - 4096, bv_unsigned sp)].

  Section J.
